VERDICT
  PROVED: the owner-doubling packet is an adjacent-edge current on C_7.
  PROVED: Delta_F(2t)^2 <= (16/29) E_pc for the THM-913 Laplacian energy.
  PROVED: Delta_F(2t)=C_2(E)+a finite 14-cycle slow-wall endpoint sum.
  PROVED: -23/784 <= synchronized-wall term <= 229/5488, sharp.
  EXACT BANK: D<=10 and D<t<=4D, 6,900 rows; all three identities pass.
  NEGATIVE: the raw E_pc threshold does not certify every scanned row.
  OPEN: bound the noncommon gcd-lattice wall sum with its relation sidecar.
